CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1791357871
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,ARainmakers: The drones used to seed
OL,4,Aclouds
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis approach to weather modification,
OL,7,Fnow more than 80-years-old, involves
OL,8,Fusing planes and drones to disperse
OL,9,Fcompounds such as silver iodide into
OL,10,Fclouds to form ice crystals. Those
OL,11,Fcrystals eventually become large enough
OL,12,Fto fall as rain or snow, depending on
OL,13,Fthe temperatures below.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
