OL,3,AAmazon wins global rights to stream
OL,4,AEmmys in six-year deal
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmazon Prime Video has secured
OL,7,Fexclusive global rights to stream the
OL,8,FEmmy Awards under a six-year deal,
OL,9,Fending the ceremony's run on
OL,10,Ftraditional US broadcast television.
OL,12,FStarting in 2027, the agreement
OL,13,Freplaces a rotation of the gala among
OL,14,Fmajor networks like ABC, CBS, Fox and
OL,15,FNBC. The ceremony will instead stream
OL,16,Flive for free worldwide each September,
OL,17,Fwith no Prime Video subscription
OL,18,Fneeded.
OL,20,FOfficial terms were not disclosed. The
OL,21,FBBC has contacted Amazon and the Emmys
OL,22,Ffor comment.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
